data: {"type":"response.function_call_arguments.done","sequence_number":501,"item_id":"fc_04de6b92baab60ea016adb4376ae608191a17ccd5ea255882a","output_index":1,"arguments":"{\"obstacle_json\":\"{\\\"status\\\":\\\"TASK_INCOMPLETE\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"wave-map-energy candidate 6; R002/R003/R004 and source closure remain open\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"I advanced the same-stage draft rather than restarting: fixed the full-target paraphrase, registered and probed a real Mathlib integral-zero theorem and used it in R001, expanded N001's exported time-window/variable quantifiers, and repaired the empty-support case in R003 by enlarging C to the nonempty compact C∪{0}. Candidate 6 passes the NL0 structural checker, but structure is not mathematical acceptance. The requested ambient Borel/Lebesgue finite-on-compacts proof, source registration/review, R004 direct N001 input and M011-based integration-by-parts rewrite, unused-source removal, and all actual application/declaration details are still unfinished. I am not submitting this incomplete candidate as the requested complete revised graph.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"check_artifact candidate_number 6 reports STRUCTURE-PASSED and mathematics_automatically_verified=false. M015 integral_zero was successfully probed and official Bochner.Basic.lean lines 217–222 inspected. M011/M012/M013/M014 source probes and previous Mathlib source readings inform the remaining work. Independent Audit A findings identify R004's missing compact-support basis and integral-coordinate transport defect.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Same-stage candidate 6 derives from prior-candidate.json, not a reset. Changed full_target to include the approved support quantifiers, sphere-normal scalar condition, Frobenius energy and endpoint convention; added M015 and direct R001 use so pointwise zero implies zero integral via the actual theorem; exported expanded N001 support/regularity facts; handled empty C in R003 without strengthening H. Source probes succeeded for existing M001/M003/M004/M005/M006/M007/M008/M009/M010, and added M015; M011, M012, M013, M014 also queried. Candidate 6 structurally validates, but has no Audit A receipt and remains mathematically incomplete. Continue with own candidate via base_candidate=6 and patch. Need source for Euclidean finite-on-compacts; use direct N001 input in R004, rewrite via M011 and prove its integrability/derivative hypotheses from N001; remove M003/M007/M010 if no longer used; complete other support, ambient definitions, and checks before submission.\\\"}\"}"}

