upport/regularity facts; handled empty C in R003 without strengthening H. Source probes succeeded for existing M001/M003/M004/M005/M006/M007/M008/M009/M010, and added M015; M011, M012, M013, M014 also queried. Candidate 6 structurally validates, but has no Audit A receipt and remains mathematically incomplete. Continue with own candidate via base_candidate=6 and patch. Need source for Euclidean finite-on-compacts; use direct N001 input in R004, rewrite via M011 and prove its integrability/derivative hypotheses from N001; remove M003/M007/M010 if no longer used; complete other support, ambient definitions, and checks before submission.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}}

